\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\lang1040\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Beloved, let us love:
\par Love is of God;
\par In God alone hasth love
\par Its true abode.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Beloved, let us love:
\par For they who love,
\par They only are His sons,
\par Born from above.
\par \pard\tx1575\tab 
\par \pard\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Beloved, let us love:
\par For love is rest,
\par And he who loveth not,
\par \pard\tx1890 Abides unblest.\tab 
\par \pard 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Beloved, let us love:
\par In love is light,
\par And he who loveth not,
\par Dwelleth in night.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Beloved, let us love:
\par For only thus
\par Shall we behold that God
\par Who loveth us.\f1 
\par \lang1033\f2 
\par }

